    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bed3c30cb5c9b88b4db8faf2d3ab40539111eb731b2c1ff0fc7867d0352d29fb",
      "text": "After breakfast, the next exciting adventure is a Kayaking experience. \n\nAs paddlers set out on the water, the tranquility of the Pantanal surrounds them. The gentle strokes of the paddles create a rhythmic sound that harmonizes with the ambient sounds of nature, providing a peaceful backdrop for the journey. The expansive water channels, bordered by lush vegetation, offer a unique perspective on the Pantanal's vibrant ecosystem.\n\nThe calm and shallow waters of the Pantanal are ideal for kayaking, providing an opportunity for paddlers to witness the underwater world through the clear surface. Aquatic plants and fish may be visible beneath the kayak, adding to the immersive experience. \n\nAfter that, go back to the hotel to have lunch and wait for your next adventure.\n\nIn the afternoon, the expert guides will take you to an unusual type of fishing. Sportfishing for piranhas in the Pantanal is an exhilarating adventure that combines the thrill of angling with the unique challenge of catching one of the most notorious and fascinating freshwater species.\n\nAs the boat glides through the calm waters, the surrounding landscape of lush vegetation and diverse wildlife sets the scene for the fishing expedition. The thrill of reeling in a piranha, known for its powerful and aggressive behavior, adds excitement to the experience.\n\nDuring the excursion, the guide shares insights into the behavior and ecology of piranhas, contributing to a deeper understanding of these fascinating creatures. After the catch-and-release activity, participants can relish the satisfaction of having successfully engaged in a thrilling and authentic sportfishing experience in the heart of the Pantanal's rich and diverse ecosystem.\n\nAfter the pristine journey, return to the hotel for dinner and rest.",
